    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Police Force - Law and Honor</h2>A global multiplayer battle-royale game in a cartoon-style world as a police officer, soldier, or mercenary. Play in single-player mode, or show off your skills in battle royale and play with potential friends around the world in multiplayer tournaments and campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/1243f85ebaa72060d44e53cb39c51710.poster.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/1243f85ebaa72060d44e53cb39c51710.webm?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Fight as either a mercenary who fights for his honor or a soldier who fights for the law. Explore the lore of the game while you play with your friends around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay: Play with friends around the world!</h2><br>A global multiplayer game in a cartoon-style world as a police officer, soldier, or mercenary. Show off your skills in a battle royale. The game includes both single-player and multiplayer game features so that you can play the game by yourself, play with friends, or play with potential friends around the world.<br><br>The game has over thirty (30+) default heroes and a lot of upcoming special heroes, special event heroes, notable or popular figure characters, and potential custom heroes (influencer pledges) that you can order by funding our Kickstarter campaign.<br>The game also has over twenty (20+) default battlefield maps you can explore, as well as a lot of upcoming special maps, special event maps, notable or landmark maps, and potential custom maps you can order by funding our Kickstarter campaign.<br><br>Choose a side: either fight for the law or fight for your honor. Who will prevail? Find out by playing our game, which you can make possible by funding our project.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/7ea42867cabb6de7140896abab0e1b6e.poster.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/7ea42867cabb6de7140896abab0e1b6e.webm?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/7ea42867cabb6de7140896abab0e1b6e.mp4?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/a504e20b6a5f44dc35a215768b64d965.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/1c43b04ba7d278b178bfa58722962619.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/8c421710fe47ff73bc42808b02b74917.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/a77f7422ebc22aa5c502375a29890cb6.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/fbd1fe6bb88a5c76e1a2ec22df1d2bc4.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/6afc085445f27759f231951fe868d906.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/9c4df10411daf98cff30215698af5e18.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/ddad7d41e5b8474e23a96ac3c90ce793.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/a0a07fc787e90fde2858b5d373ef67f3.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=286 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Influencer: Play with celebrities!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/3fc3c225f2765279aed036905dde734b.poster.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/3fc3c225f2765279aed036905dde734b.webm?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>These celebrities have funded this game in our Kickstarter campaign. Spot your favorite celebrities in their avatars as playable characters. \ud83c\udf99\ufe0f<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u2728Pledge the Influencer tier in our Kickstarter crowdfunding campaign to get your own custom hero. <br></li><li>\ud83d\udce7 You can also contact us through email if you have any concerns or inquiries.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Writer: Community-driven lore!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/4583aab3a1ae9931870b0a24329c61f5.poster.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/4583aab3a1ae9931870b0a24329c61f5.webm?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Play the game lore the community have collaborated to write. \ud83d\udcda<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \u2728Pledge the Story Writer tier in our Kickstarter crowdfunding campaign to write your own story or event in the game.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udce7 You can also contact us through email if you have any concerns or inquiries.</li></ul><br>- End of description -",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Police Force - Law and Honor</h2>A global multiplayer battle-royale game in a cartoon-style world as a police officer, soldier, or mercenary. Play in single-player mode, or show off your skills in battle royale and play with potential friends around the world in multiplayer tournaments and campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/1243f85ebaa72060d44e53cb39c51710.poster.avif?t=1704901398\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756760/extras/1243f85ebaa72060d44e53cb39c51710.webm?t=1704901398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Fight as either a mercenary who fights for his honor or a soldier who fights for the law. Explore the lore of the game while you play with your friends around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay: Play with friends around the world!</h2><br>A global multiplayer game in a cartoon-style world as a police officer, soldier, or mercenary. Show off your skills in a battle royale. The game includes both single-player and multiplayer game features so that you can play the game by yourself, play with friends, or play with potential friends around the world.<br><br>The game has over thirty (30+) default heroes and a lot of upcoming special heroes, special event heroes, notable or popular figure characters, and potential custom heroes (influencer pledges) that you can order by funding our Kickstarter campaign.<br>The game also has over twenty (20+) default battlefield maps you can explore, as well as a lot of upcoming special maps, special event maps, notable or landmark maps, and potential custom maps you can order by funding our Kickstarter campaign.<br><br>Choose a side: either fight for the law or fight for your honor. Who will prevail? Find out